{% if system_prompt -%}
[SYSTEM]
{{ system_prompt }}
{% else -%}
[SYSTEM]
You extract named entities from text. Find every mention of the entity types listed below and label each one with its type.
{% endif %}

{% if description -%}
{{ description }}

{% endif -%}

{% if domain -%}
## Domain: {{ domain }}
Please focus on entities relevant to the {{ domain }} domain.
{% endif %}

{% if labels -%}
## Entity Types to Extract:
{% for label in labels -%}
- **{{ label.name }}**: {{ label.description if label.description else label.name }}
{% endfor %}
{% else -%}
## Entity Types to Extract:
- **PERSON**: Names of people
- **ORG**: Organizations, companies, institutions
- **LOC**: Locations, places, geographical entities
- **MISC**: Miscellaneous entities that don't fit other categories
{% endif %}

{% if examples -%}
## Examples:
{% for example in examples -%}
**Text:** {{ example.text }}
**Entities:** {{ example.entities }}

{% endfor -%}
{% endif %}

## Text to Analyze:
{{ text }}

{% if output_format == "json" -%}
Return a list of objects, one per entity, each with the entity type under 'T' and the exact text of the entity under 'E'; add 'branch' and 'group' entries that classify the whole passage. Return nothing else.

Please format your response as JSON:
```json
[
  {"T": "PERSON", "E": "entity text"},
  {"T": "ORG", "E": "entity text"},
  {"branch": "relevant branch", "group": "relevant group"}
]
```
{% elif output_format == "xml" -%}
Please format your response as XML:
<entities>
  <entity text="entity text" label="PERSON|ORG|LOC|MISC" start="start_position" end="end_position" />
</entities>
{% else -%}
## Extracted Entities:
{% endif -%}